(footprint "TS06_PinHeader_2x12_Back"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "2x12 2.54 mm stacking HEADER, on the display board's back. Pin 1 square and at 185 V; position 4 HAS NO HOLE - it is the key, snipped on the header and plugged on the socket, and the silkscreen ring marks it. Odd pins in one column, even in the other, rows stepping along y (KiCad PinHeader_2x12_P2.54mm_Vertical numbering). Mounted on the BACK: geometry mirrored in X from the KiCad library original, graphics on B.* layers.")
	(tags "header 2x12 stacking THT TERMINAL-06")
